    main.innerHTML=`<section class="mc-card ms-market-card"><div class="ms-heading"><div><span class="ms-eyebrow">STRATEGY LAB</span><h2>策略回測研究台</h2><p class="mc-muted">先看 K 圖，再用自己的條件建立策略。設定不會自動變成交易委託。</p></div><span class="mc-pill">日線 · 個股／ETF</span></div><form class="ms-market-search"><label>代號或完整股票名稱<input name="symbol" list="ms-symbols" autocomplete="off" value="${esc(seed)}" placeholder="例如 2330 或台積電" required></label><datalist id="ms-symbols"></datalist><button type="submit">載入 K 圖</button></form><div class="ms-market-status" role="status">正在讀取日線…</div><div class="ms-market-chart"></div><details class="ms-audit" open><summary>逐日驗算：為什麼符合／不符合？</summary><form data-audit-form><label>訊號日期<input type="date" name="auditDate" required></label><button type="submit">查看當日數值</button></form><div data-audit-result role="status">載入行情後，選日期或點選 K 棒驗算。訊號成立後，下一交易日開盤才模擬成交。</div></details></section><section class="mc-card ms-strategy-card"><div class="ms-heading"><div><h2>我的策略</h2><p class="mc-muted">範例可修改；每個條件都有獨立參數。</p></div><button type="button" data-new-strategy>＋新增策略</button></div><div class="ms-strategy-pickers"><label>已儲存策略<select data-saved-strategies><option value="">尚未選擇</option></select></label><label>新手範例<select data-template><option value="trend">均線交叉</option><option value="breakout">突破放量</option><option value="rsi">RSI 回升</option><option value="macd">MACD 交叉</option><option value="kd">KD 交叉</option><option value="hold">買進持有</option><option value="formula">自訂公式範例</option></select></label></div><div data-strategy-editor></div></section><section class="mc-card"><h2>回測期間與資金</h2><form data-run-strategy><div class="mc-grid"><label>起始日期<input type="date" name="start" value="${dateDays(180)}" required></label><label>結束日期<input type="date" name="end" value="${dateDays(1)}" max="${dateDays(1)}" required></label>${number('capital','初始資金（元）',100000,100,1000000000)}<label>每次投入方式<select name="sizing"><option value="ratio">可用資金比例</option><option value="amount">固定金額</option></select></label>${number('allocation','可用資金比例（%）',100,1,100)}${number('amount','固定投入金額（元）',10000,1,1000000000)}</div><details><summary>手續費、稅與滑價（依自己的交易條件調整）</summary><div class="mc-grid">${number('fee','單邊手續費（%）',.1425,0,5,.0001)}${number('tax','賣出交易稅（%）',.3,0,5,.0001)}${number('slip','單邊滑價（%）',.05,0,5,.0001)}</div><p class="mc-muted">股票與不同 ETF 稅率可能不同，請確認。未計最低手續費、配息、流動性與漲跌停成交限制。</p></details><div class="ms-execution-note">收盤條件確認後隔日開盤成交；停損／停利使用日K開高低價，跳空按開盤價。同棒同時觸及停損與停利，以停損優先；賣出當日不重新買進。</div><p class="ms-validation-note">目前為股票／ETF 日線、單一多單部位；報酬不含配息，未模擬最低費用、流動性及漲跌停排隊。最大回撤以每日收盤權益計算。</p><button class="mc-primary" type="submit">執行策略回測</button></form><div data-strategy-status role="status"></div></section><div data-strategy-result></div><section class="mc-card"><h2>回測紀錄</h2><div data-run-history></div><p class="mc-muted">策略與回測紀錄依會員儲存，同步進度請看會員中心上方。新版紀錄保留當次規則、參數、行情快照及引擎版本；舊紀錄可能沒有行情。</p></section>`;
    const host=main.querySelector('.ms-market-chart'),plot=makeChart(host,date=>{main.querySelector('[name=auditDate]').value=date;renderAudit(date);}),status=main.querySelector('[data-strategy-status]'),quoteStatus=main.querySelector('.ms-market-status');
